Package: ubuntu-handheld-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Gaming-optimized gsettings overrides for Ubuntu handhelds
 Ubuntu handheld devices and gaming consoles benefit from a dark UI theme
 to reduce screen glare and save battery on OLED displays. This package
 provides gsettings overrides that prefer dark mode across GTK applications.
